updated_at: "2026-10-23T21:13:34.917Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "F03: reverse blocks and unresolved prerequisites are held with blocker evidence until resolved; F05: custom terminal roles are excluded and custom active statuses remain eligible across brief lifecycle views; F14: multilingual brief delta and divergence budgets use SDK UTF-8 estimates for exact output"
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T20:25:08.967Z",codex-agent,"Verified F03 F05 F14 against origin/main cdcd1e3: outgoing-only active-ID blockers miss reverse blocks and missing targets, lifecycle helpers hard-code spellings, and both estimators divide UTF-16 length by four. All findings valid. The pinned SDK exports runtime status and UTF-8 estimation helpers plus blocker resolution; preserve legacy depends_on aliases at the SDK boundary. Owner explicitly groups these findings in one PR."
  "2026-10-23T20:33:07.947Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses public isTerminalStatus (the SDK alias-normalizing terminal-role wrapper), resolveRuntimeStatusRegistry/readSettings, indexBlockedByIds plus resolveItemBlockers, and estimatePmOutputTokens. Published minimum SDK 2026.10.13 exports all imports, so dev/peer and manifest floors remain unchanged. Preserve depends_on as a blocker alias and external source provenance. Divergence classification has no lifecycle predicate, while delta transitions and duplicate remediation now receive the workspace registry. Focused native non-git regressions pass 4/4; pm-linked run passed 3/3 before the external-provenance case was added."
  "2026-10-23T20:39:54.269Z",codex-agent,"Isolated behavioural revert proofs after rebuilding: F03 reverting only blockerRelationships fails F03 at reverse blocks must hold A (exit 1). F05 restoring only legacy isClosed/isClosedStatus bodies fails F05 because accepted and the accepted Decision return to next candidates (exit 1). F14 reverting only estimateTokens and measureRenderedBrief to UTF-16 length fails F14 at the emitted-byte ceiling (exit 1). Each proof ran node --test --test-name-pattern=<finding>: test/sdk-semantics.test.ts after npm run build. Restored all functions and rebuilt. Final lifecycle helper uses the named statusIsTerminal SDK export. Existing optional local strict-health warnings are extension host skew and merge_fence_drift:2 tracked by pm-brief-fence165, with history_drift clean. No fence or history repair is in scope."
  "2026-10-23T21:02:47.341Z",codex-agent,"Clean-identity npm run release:check passed: 429 tests, 0 failures, 0 skipped; coverage 100.00 percent lines, 98.11 percent branches, 100.00 percent functions across all 4 production sources at unchanged thresholds. Packed acceptance passed npm-current and bun-current on SDK 2026.10.20 plus npm-minimum on SDK 2026.10.13, each with typed cannot-fit exit 2. Changelog and publish-attestation checks passed. Clean-identity bun run release:check is running. Preparing a draft PR so remote CI can run concurrently."
  "2026-10-23T21:05:45.603Z",codex-agent,"Draft PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/173 opened with finding evidence and the requested main-path item link. Remote CI is running. DeepScan reports one new static issue and inspection found an unused root binding in the new regression file. Removed that binding and its sole import dependency without changing production code or test assertions. Test compilation passes; awaiting the refreshed static check. Local npm release gate is green and the full Bun gate continues."
  "2026-10-23T21:13:27.563Z",codex-agent,"Final local validation: clean-identity npm run release:check and bun run release:check both passed 429/429 tests, 0 failures, 0 skipped. All 4 production sources reported: npm coverage lines/branches/functions 100.00/98.11/100.00 percent; Bun 100.00/98.07/100.00 percent. Thresholds unchanged at 100/97.85/100. Packed npm-current, bun-current and npm-minimum acceptance passed 3/3 in each gate, including minimum SDK 2026.10.13. Changelog and publish-attestation checks passed. Final pm-linked node --test test/sdk-semantics.test.ts passed 4/4. Repeated isolated rebuild/revert proofs: F03 fails reverse blocks must hold A; F05 fails accepted-item exclusion; F14 fails json: 490 exceeds 441. All three exit 1 under their isolated revert and pass after restoration; restored source matches the committed file exactly."
  "2026-10-23T21:13:31.690Z",codex-agent,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/173 is verified at code head 4cc9cacf9dc55d30e489c96208d2a38576a3ed84: CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/actions/runs/40024255385 passed all 5 jobs (npm and Bun release gates, Node 22 and 26 tests, Windows audit); CodeQL, Semgrep, DeepScan and Hound passed. DeepScan cleared after the unused fixture binding cleanup. CodeRabbit skipped the draft and is not review approval. Final receipt commit will receive fresh CI. Findings F03/F05/F14 are all valid and fixed, no dependency or manifest bump required. Releasing the claim while retaining in_progress for orchestrator verification; no merge or release performed. Existing optional local strict-health fence/skew warnings remain outside this change and are documented above."
